# R240 (.136aj) RESOLUTION: the R237 '_M204' alias was a TRAP. Klipper's
# dispatcher builds command names from [A-Z_] only - digits END the name -
# so an extended macro can never be called '_M204'. The alias made our own
# '_M204_SET VALUE=8000' dispatch as '_M204' + rawparams '_SET VALUE=8000'
# -> shlex ValueError -> 'Malformed command' -> the .136ai START BLOCKER
